<title>USA: N. Highlands High School, N.J., won by Ryan Beck.</title>
<headline>N. Highlands High School, N.J., won by Ryan Beck.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it won $2.650 million of Northern Highlands Regional High School District, N.J., school bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.964 percent.</p>
</text>
